    {
      "text": "Limhi sends proclamation among people to gather, Mosiah 7:17. proclamation to be sent to gather flocks and drive them into wilderness by night, Mosiah 22:6. Mosiah2 sends proclamation that unbelievers should not persecute believers, Mosiah 27:2. Lamanite king sends proclamation throughout land not to harm Aaron3 and brethren, Alma 22:27 (23:1). proclamation calls followers of Korihor to repent, Alma 30:57. proclamation announces murder of chief judge and capture of murderers, Hel. 9:9. Lachoneus1 sends proclamation that all people should gather in one place, 3 Ne. 3:13, 22.",
